# Personal stress-test material (never commit, never ship).
# The source game moved from public/ to the repo root (it was being packaged into the desktop
# app and blew the installer past the NSIS limit). Both locations stay listed: .gitignore does
# NOT keep anything out of a BUILD — that is package.json build.files — and these paths are
# a commercial game that must never be committed or shipped.
/public/OurLife/
/public/OurLife-Step1-Build-Spec.md
/OurLife/
/OurLife-Step1-Build-Spec.md
/ourlife-out/
# Converter fixtures must stay text-only (counts/identifiers, never game content).
/tools/renpy-convert/fixtures/**/*.png
/tools/renpy-convert/fixtures/**/*.jpg
/tools/renpy-convert/fixtures/**/*.ogg
